    "Both files preserve compared-minus-reference semantics, immutable calculation identifiers, units, statuses, warnings and provider provenance. They do not assess model accuracy." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Begge filene bevarer sammenlignet-minus-referanse-semantikk, uforanderlige beregningsidentifikatorer, enheter, statuser, advarsler og leverandørens opprinnelse. De vurderer ikke modellens nøyaktighet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Boundary contains gaps; invalid or discontinuous points are not joined." : {
