    "The 5×5 grid includes the operating point as the central point. Even grids evaluate the operating point separately." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "5×5 rutenettet inkluderer driftspunktet som sentralt punkt. Selv rutenett vurderer driftspunktet separat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The IFE Flow Technology department is developing a proprietary thermodynamic model for CO₂ and CO₂-rich systems. Model development is supported by experimental validation, including measurements performed in IFE's FALCON CO₂ facility." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "IFEs avdeling for strømningsteknologi utvikler en egen termodynamisk modell for CO₂ og CO₂-rike systemer. Modellutviklingen støttes av eksperimentell validering, blant annet målinger utført i IFEs FALCON-anlegg for CO₂."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved inputs, results and provenance will be removed from this device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
